Taking the Paris metro? Say THIS 🚇🇫🇷

• quelle ligne ? = which line?
• descendre = to get off
• le quai = the platform
• tout droit = straight ahead
• changer = to change (trains)

🗼 Where is your first stop in Paris? Comment "Je vais à ___" 👇
💌 Save this for your Paris trip
👯 Send it to your travel buddy

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

